mpi im2col

For this assignment, I have created two solutions, found in ./source 
I have assumed an image is just a float*, as specified in the example sequential
code. I generate a random float* of floats from 0-1 instead of reading in a real
image, although I do not see why my solution(s) are not generalizable to real 
images as well.

